  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Because of the java package renaming, the migration tool used to upgrade 2.x repositories to 3.x does not work (see ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FCR30/Upgrading+from+2.x)"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FCR30/Upgrading+from+2.x)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ".",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "We could either",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "1 just update the tool against the latest server jars, and update the references to fedora.fcfg where module etc names have changed",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "2 update package names in this migration tool as well",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "3 go the whole way and mavenise it as well.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
