  "description": "<p>Because of the java package renaming, the migration tool used to upgrade 2.x repositories to 3.x does not work (see <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FCR30/Upgrading+from+2.x\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FCR30/Upgrading+from+2.x</a>).</p>\n\n<p>We could either<br/>\n1 just update the tool against the latest server jars, and update the references to fedora.fcfg where module etc names have changed<br/>\n2 update package names in this migration tool as well<br/>\n3 go the whole way and mavenise it as well.</p>",
